{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey into the magical world of Epica and compete against other players from around the world in the rankings.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy adventure &amp; exploration game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting &amp; trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global rankings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >State of Epica</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is accessible during Early Access, the core development stage. The game went through several major updates, including the upgrade from Unreal Engine 4 to 5, and newer changes preparing the game for multiplayer.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current scope centers on bringing the starting zone (Act 1) to life, which includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player gear\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various world locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ec74d9aecc7bb35793c9545677696578235cfe95.jpg","localized_name":"Level up!","name":"Level up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1281480/ec74d9aecc7bb35793c9545677696578235cfe95.jpg"},{"icon":"f6ed93472bb14f7de59eaf2677b686fef7a35f4d.jpg","localized_name":"Recruit","name":"Recruit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1281480/f6ed93472bb14f7de59eaf2677b686fef7a35f4d.jpg"},{"icon":"daf56775d2cfad5981720